I seem to remember playing a version of nethack (or hack) a long
time ago which had grenades in it.  You applied them, waited for
a turn or two and threw them and after a few more turns they would
blow up, causing loads of damage.  What was even more fun was
when you were about to die, applying all your grenades.  For example
if you are dying of food poisoning, you could apply a grenade and 
leave it next to the stairs, so when somebody else came to check out
that (bones) level, they would get a grenade in the face on the first
turn. :-)  What ever happened to them?

-Bharat

